<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.auth.beginOrganizationSsoAdmission(input: BeginOrganizationSsoAdmissionInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<BeginOrganizationSsoAdmissionOutput>
```
</Tab>
